1.0.3 2026-10-30

  - events.tsv for 24 of the 31 runs (sub-01: study phase only) and task-scenerecognition_events.json: task events
    rebuilt with code/fix-20261030_events.py, a Python port of the authors' MATLAB event pipeline in sourcedata/
    (trial onsets = sync pulses; eye events and behavioural columns from the EyeLink and behavioural files).
  - derivatives/events-our-alignment (21 files): events for runs and phases left out of the main tables (sub-01
    test phase, sub-03 runs 1, 2 and 4, sub-05 run 1, sub-06 runs 1, 2 and 4), aligned with our own EyeLink-to-
    iEEG clock fit, not the authors' method; code/fix-20261031_events_our_alignment.py; main events.tsv files
    unaffected.
  - README: the published text is kept unchanged; paragraphs added after it describe the events and the derivative
    (the published statement that no events.tsv is generated is superseded).

1.0.2 2026-10-16
  - Restore the descriptive dataset Name recorded in the v1.0.0 history. Update generated metadata title and source hash.

1.0.1 2026-10-07
  - 2026-10-07 metadata enrichment: participants (diagnosis, implant type, implanted hemispheres, channel/contact
    counts, sampling frequency, recording year-month from EyeLink headers; age/sex cohort-level only),
    participants.json cohort clinical summary, ieeg.json task timing/instructions/ground, README sections,
    references/keywords. Sources: Kragel et al. 2021 Sci Adv (PMC8213228), Zenodo 4728229 release files.

1.0.0 2026-10-06
  - Initial iEEG-BIDS packaging of Zenodo record 4728229 (no signal processing).
